[{"client_msg_id":"F4F39282-F691-4EFE-949D-2B1C225F04E8","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"この季節になると、毎年山にN2爆雷を放ちたくなります。","ts":"1616244983.044300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5IP1V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27ee4cf9-1809-4af9-92fc-7a5552bfd5f4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"耳への経路も炎症あるしね","ts":"1616244865.043100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ajCB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"AF633EA7-B402-4CB1-A9AD-3E7D7E69CBC0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あと、鼻かみすぎて耳も痛いし聞こえづらくなってきた気がする。","ts":"1616244831.042000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4GLKR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"710b5014-85eb-441a-9899-5a2ad2464704","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、そこはわかります。\nそこまでいかないけど、花粉症でそこそこ鼻にくる(きていた)ので","ts":"1616244825.041700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"btc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9B1D6041-E6AA-46A3-89BB-AD077E659AE2","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ちなみに、目が痛くなるのとの因果関係は、鼻の奥が炎症で腫れて圧迫されるからだそうです。","ts":"1616244708.040500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kt39"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EE666661-1049-4919-A508-DB74A55554A6","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"前に鼻詰まりで目が痛くなったときがあって、そのときは急性蓄膿炎と診断されたんですよね。今回もそれだったら、まじで手術を考えてみます。","ts":"1616244643.039100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xT=Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1d594e0f-0a78-4a80-bfb3-f2dcad4b9551","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ診断によるでしょうけど、つらいですねえ...","ts":"1616244372.036400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z2XWr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F2B0E1F9-A706-414E-B1AF-E5D8AE898496","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"鼻の手術を真剣に考えてみるべきかもしれない。","ts":"1616244253.036000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+l5I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"BFDF8979-F8E7-4BC7-B29C-658D5B31DB11","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ここ2日くらい目の奥が痛いなと思って、今朝鼻をかんだら、めっちゃ黄色い鼻水が大量に出て、目の痛みがマシになったので、鼻が詰まりすぎて膿んできた可能性が高い。 :totemoturai: ","ts":"1616244223.035300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8JZLQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3399566-7623-44b2-8ed0-0c91b2ab026d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なお、味はよくなかったです","ts":"1616204487.032200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cvi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e839dbf-f9d1-4151-9515-fd1d450bd1f9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"以前、ウイスキーの燗をためしてみたときにダメージおいました","ts":"1616204482.032000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"y42"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1a00f71e-cbe5-4c7f-b607-04bb367b133b","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あー鼻にアルコールつらいのめっちゃわかる・・・","ts":"1616204465.031400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nfDkL"}]}]
